71"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":3246,"title":"Leviticus 17:11","segments":["For the life of the flesh [is] in the blood: and I have given it to you upon the altar to make an atonement for your souls: for it [is] the blood [that] maketh an atonement for the soul."],"ref":"Leviticus 17:11","verse":11,"words":[{"text":"For the life","strong":"H5315"},{"text":" of the flesh","strong":"H1320"},{"text":" [is] in the blood","strong":"H1818"},{"text":": and I have given","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" it to you upon the altar","strong":"H4196"},{"text":" to make an atonement","strong":"H3722"},{"text":" for your souls","strong":"H5315"},{"text":": for it [is] the blood","strong":"H1818"},{"text":" [that] maketh an atonement","strong":"H3722"},{"text":" for the soul","strong":"H5315"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":3247,"title":"Leviticus 17:12","segments":["Therefore I said unto the children of Israel, No soul of you shall eat blood, neither shall any stranger that sojourneth among you eat blood."],"ref":"Leviticus 17:12","verse":12,"words":[{"text":"Therefore I said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":", No soul","strong":"H5315"},{"text":" of you shall eat","strong":"H398"},{"text":" blood","strong":"H1818"},{"text":", neither shall any stranger","strong":"H1616"},{"text":" that sojourneth","strong":"H1481"},{"text":" among","strong":"H8432"},{"text":" you eat","strong":"H398"},{"text":" blood","strong":"H1818"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":3248,"title":"Leviticus 17:13","segments":["And whatsoever man [there be] of the children of Israel, or of the strangers that sojourn among you, which hunteth and catcheth any beast or fowl that may be eaten; he shall even pour out the blood thereof, and cover it with dust. {which...: Heb. that hunteth any hunting}"],"ref":"Leviticus 17:13","verse":13,"words":[{"text":"And whatsoever man","strong":"H376"},{"text":" [there be] of the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","stron